++++++++++++++++
+ 2D test data +
++++++++++++++++

2D Vibroseis Line 001, https://wiki.seg.org/wiki/2D_Vibroseis_Line_001

Download
--------
https://ftps.geofizyka.pl/main.html?download&weblink=973286ef2a219064126f69fd6b8f77c6&realfilename=2D_Land_vibro_data_2ms.tgz

Extraction
----------
$> tar xvzf 2D_Land_vibro_data_2ms.tgz

Information on the data
-----------------------
$> cat Line_001.TXT

After successful extraction of all files, you can delete 2D_Land_vibro_data_2ms.tgz: 
$> rm -f 2D_Land_vibro_data_2ms.tgz

